      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-osd</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-osd for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fix the installed directories and fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact
      versions recorded in the existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">sed -i 's|.unwrap_or("/usr/libexec/polkit-agent-helper-1")|.unwrap_or("/usr/lib/polkit-1/polkit-agent-helper-1")|' \
  src/subscriptions/polkit_agent_helper.rs &amp;&amp;

cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --profile release --frozen</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vm755 target/release/cosmic-osd /usr/bin/cosmic-osd</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

